   The RakNet wire format implemented in shared/include/shared/net/ and
   shared/src/net/ (BitStream semantics, internal-packet header layout,
   ACK range encoding) was ported to C++ using that project's
   core/bitstream.py and core/protocol.py as the reference implementation.
   No Black Russia/SA-MP login, authentication or bot logic from that
   project is used in this codebase.

2) RakNet offline-message constants (OFFLINE_MESSAGE_DATA_ID, unconnected
   ping/pong ids) and the SA-MP server query format are long-public
   protocol conventions used by server browsers; implemented from those
   public formats.

